  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.creeperhost.net%252fapplyPromo%252fHomeGrownMods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/576589/description_c104abd7-58db-4f58-b718-a8ddafa3364f.png\"></a></p>\n<p>“PolyLib”由 CreeperHost Ltd. 开发，是一款轻量级的 Minecraft 库模组，专注于提供一系列辅助类。这些类旨在简化模组开发的各个方面，提供便于创建图形用户界面（GUI）的工具以及其他开发增强功能，以提升效率和用户体验。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>PolyLib 基于&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury</a> 构建，支持 NeoForge、Forge 和 Fabric。自 Minecraft 26.1.2 起，已不再需要 Architectury。</p>\n<p>PolyLib 为开源项目，可在 <a href=\"https://github.com/CreeperHost/PolyLib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上获取。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>需要 PolyLib 的模组</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeperhost-presents-soul-shards\" rel=\"nofollow\">SoulShards</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blockshot\" rel=\"nofollow\">BlockShot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeperhost-minetogether\" rel=\"nofollow\">MineTogether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shrink_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shrink</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeperhost-presents-steves-carts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Steve's Carts 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeperhost-presents-chickens\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chickens</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Jab125/Jab125/main/imgs/requiredArchitecturyApi.png\" width=\"382\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p><br>&nbsp;</p>",
